# Geometer's Arthropod: whenever you cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, look at the top X cards of your library, put one of
# them into your hand and the rest on the bottom in a random order. Pterafractyl cast for X = 3 looks at exactly the top three
# (Mountain, Lightning Bolt, Forest); Bot1 takes the Bolt and the other two go to the bottom, so the fourth card, Giant Growth,
# is now on top and is the card Bot1 draws on turn 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Geometer's Arthropod
Pterafractyl
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Forest
Giant Growth
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

